Subject: [PATCH 1/9] field-mcp: attest is Tier 3, never a tool (Don's ruling
 2026-10-30; C-1014 F-C941-1)

attest records a HUMAN re-attestation. It moves to a written Tier 3 exclusion; Tier 2 is 7 tools, the total 56 and the Tier 3
exclusions 21 in the catalog, tests, README and snapshot. A test pins the exclusion and 'unknown tool' by name.

