Subject: [PATCH 2/9] field-mcp: the operator pair goes only to the two routes
 that verify it (C-1014 F-C869-3, F-C869-4 T17)

POST /agents and POST /export are the only Tier 2 receivers with an operator guard. The other five writes, the audit
append and every read carry no pair; a half pair is never sent. Per-route test and pinned README wording.

