From: Don Hagell <13129187+dhagell@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 01:16:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] field-mcp: a write whose result was not seen says
 'outcome unknown; do not retry' and the ledger gets an outcome row (C-1014
 F-C869-2)

A timeout or broken reply after the request was sent no longer reads like a refused connection; a retry could act twice.
One mcp.write.outcome row (status only, best effort) follows every write; the intent row gains a call id to join them.

