Subject: [PATCH 6/9] field-mcp: a reason with nothing printable is refused,
 stored text is cleaned, destructive hint pinned (C-1014 F-C869-4, F-C941
 items T21 and S2)

Zero-width and bidi-control characters are dropped and control characters become spaces before a reason is stored; a
reason that is empty after that is refused before any call. The destructive hint follows the blast radius, pinned.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Nkc8NyA9oxEDcNhmidZ9gg
---
